&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE piMudaPadrao DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE piMudaPadrao :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

    IF AVAIL {&TableName} AND
       {&TableName}.padrao THEN DO:

        FOR EACH bf{&TableName} EXCLUSIVE-LOCK
            WHERE bf{&TableName}.it-codigo = {&TableName}.it-codigo
            AND   bf{&TableName}.padrao
            AND   ROWID(bf{&TableName}) <> ROWID({&TableName}):

            ASSIGN bf{&TableName}.padrao = FALSE.

        END.

    END.

END PROCEDURE.

/* _UIB-CODE-BLOCK-END */
&ANALYZE-RESUME

